    "notes": "Approved 34-row paper-study matrix with three 10-minute TurbSim realizations at each DLC 6.4 wind speed and one DLC 6.1 U50 row. The three realizations provide an initial observed spread only; they are not a converged uncertainty estimate or a certification seed campaign. U05 and U50 full-record pilots completed 88000 steps per baseline/VorLap scenario with exact 1 RPM, valid changing SIL velocities, zero retained source violations, and stable parked-reduced-v2 wakes. A 0.01 s postprocess duration tolerance accepts QBlade exports spanning 599.992 s as the intended 600 s retained record. Raw annual parked-time probability fractions are normalized by the aggregator for the conditional parked DEL; DLC 6.1 U50 is ultimate-only. Baseline and VorLap remain paired on the exact same immutable field within each wind-speed/seed row. Exact Nyquist truncation has essentially zero anti-alias margin and is an explicit project-study assumption.",
